WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:01.730
- All right, y'all
let's close out the hour

00:00:01.730 --> 00:00:03.780
with one last bit of
joy for you, hopefully,

00:00:03.780 --> 00:00:04.990
this is "What I'm Liking".

00:00:04.990 --> 00:00:07.907
(upbeat music)
(audience applauding)

00:00:07.907 --> 00:00:10.460
(Kelly laughing)

00:00:10.460 --> 00:00:11.710
Get it, Jesse.

00:00:11.710 --> 00:00:14.220
Moms, does this sound familiar to you?

00:00:14.220 --> 00:00:15.520
I'm bored,

00:00:15.520 --> 00:00:16.770
are we there yet?

00:00:16.770 --> 00:00:18.350
Ashton got more than me,

00:00:18.350 --> 00:00:19.790
Madison stole my headphones,

00:00:19.790 --> 00:00:21.020
it's a list goes on and on,

00:00:21.020 --> 00:00:22.200
it's enough to make you wanna cry

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:23.580
or trap yourself in a bathroom

00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:25.890
and say, "You're still using
the bathroom and you're not"

00:00:25.890 --> 00:00:27.300
But that's not me,

00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:29.070
that's generally not appropriate

00:00:29.070 --> 00:00:31.630
to do in front of the kids, so I hear,

00:00:31.630 --> 00:00:33.140
but there's a group of mamas

00:00:33.140 --> 00:00:35.940
in Massachusetts letting
out all their frustrations,

00:00:35.940 --> 00:00:37.910
all their built up rage and exhaustion

00:00:37.910 --> 00:00:42.050
by gathering and releasing
guttural primal screams

00:00:42.050 --> 00:00:44.120
away from their little ones,

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:45.213
this is awesome.

00:00:46.286 --> 00:00:49.119
(women screaming)

00:00:56.283 --> 00:00:59.450
(audience applauding)

00:01:00.303 --> 00:01:02.740
It's like the new Ya-Ya
Sisterhood and it's amazing.

00:01:02.740 --> 00:01:04.460
These primal scream sessions

00:01:04.460 --> 00:01:07.550
are the brainchild of
therapist and mom, Sarah,

00:01:07.550 --> 00:01:09.090
who's on the line now,

00:01:09.090 --> 00:01:10.253
what's up, Sarah?

00:01:10.253 --> 00:01:13.300
(audience applauding)

00:01:13.300 --> 00:01:15.140
- Kelly, thank you for having me.

00:01:15.140 --> 00:01:16.910
- Oh my God, I'm so happy to talk to you,

00:01:16.910 --> 00:01:18.360
so, how did you come up with this?

00:01:18.360 --> 00:01:21.110
Were you just angry one day or...

00:01:21.110 --> 00:01:24.820
- Very angry, but talking
to my therapy clients

00:01:24.820 --> 00:01:28.240
and the community of
moms that I work with,

00:01:28.240 --> 00:01:30.610
we were talking about anger for two years,

00:01:30.610 --> 00:01:33.030
penned up frustration and rage

00:01:33.030 --> 00:01:35.940
and about really talking about
how we had nowhere to put it,

00:01:35.940 --> 00:01:37.917
so, I joked with them like,

00:01:37.917 --> 00:01:40.920
"We should just all get
in the field and scream."

00:01:40.920 --> 00:01:42.047
And they would say back to me,

00:01:42.047 --> 00:01:43.370
"Great, let's do it."

00:01:43.370 --> 00:01:45.850
So, I did the first one in March of 2021

00:01:45.850 --> 00:01:48.200
on a freezing cold Boston night,

00:01:48.200 --> 00:01:51.410
and then we did it again
in January of 2022,

00:01:51.410 --> 00:01:52.740
and we got together,

00:01:52.740 --> 00:01:55.090
we screamed our hearts out,

00:01:55.090 --> 00:01:58.860
we cried, we laughed, we
connected with each other,

00:01:58.860 --> 00:02:01.750
and really we gave each other permission

00:02:01.750 --> 00:02:04.810
to release the anger that
we've been feeling for so long,

00:02:04.810 --> 00:02:06.270
and it feels so good,

00:02:06.270 --> 00:02:08.590
and Kelly, I highly recommend it,

00:02:08.590 --> 00:02:09.861
you should try it.

00:02:09.861 --> 00:02:12.150
(audience applauding)
- I'm into it.

00:02:12.150 --> 00:02:13.590
I'm definitely into it,

00:02:13.590 --> 00:02:14.800
I love this,

00:02:14.800 --> 00:02:16.290
so, thank you so much Sarah,

00:02:16.290 --> 00:02:18.003
I'm liking your post right now.

00:02:18.003 --> 00:02:20.223
(audience applauding)

00:02:20.223 --> 00:02:21.190
All right, that's not all,

00:02:21.190 --> 00:02:22.440
our season long partner,

00:02:22.440 --> 00:02:24.210
Pilot Pin Makers of G2,

00:02:24.210 --> 00:02:25.850
the go-to pin of "The Kelly Clarkson Show"

00:02:25.850 --> 00:02:27.990
wanna honor ultimate overachievers,

00:02:27.990 --> 00:02:30.180
I can think of no better group than y'all.

00:02:30.180 --> 00:02:32.179
So, they're gonna write
you a check for $1,000.

00:02:32.179 --> 00:02:35.680
(audience applauding)

00:02:35.680 --> 00:02:36.680
- Thank you.

00:02:37.610 --> 00:02:40.010
Now you can buy some snacks
for that get together,

00:02:40.010 --> 00:02:42.469
I'm just saying, scream, snacks.

00:02:42.469 --> 00:02:44.223
(audience applauding)
Thank you so much Sarah.

